@cc [owner:OctavianTocan,label:product;motion] card-sheet-pages-stay-in-the-sheet
A card action that opens a child page MUST keep the same sheet window, panel and drag
state. The page content and heading change without restarting the sheet. At the
normal detent the panel MAY resize to the new content through the page transition;
at the tall detent the grabber and header MUST stay at the same height.
The root's cross becomes Back;
the header's Back and the phone's Back return to the parent without dismissing the
sheet. The phone's Back dismisses only from the root page. Each page MUST retain its
own scroll position when another page is shown.
Source: pulls.review `kit-sheet-pages-stay-in-the-sheet`, DESIGN rules 78 and 115,
at ee5cf358333cb1170f1923c7118e12af3f265b74; see `docs/pully-ui-reference.md`.

@cc [owner:OctavianTocan,label:product;reliability] card-space-creation-outlives-its-page
Leaving the creation page MUST NOT cancel an accepted create request or prevent its
result from refreshing the selector. Pending creation MUST remain guarded against
duplicate submission when the form is reopened. Completion MUST navigate only if
that creation page is still active.
Source: the same-sheet creation flow and its native Back/dismissal regressions,
22 October 2026.

@cc [owner:OctavianTocan,label:motion] card-sheet-pages-follow-navigation
Opening a child page MUST move it in from the right and move the parent left; Back
MUST reverse that direction. Page content travels through the Pully blurred slide,
and the grabber and header controls MUST NOT travel sideways with it. When the
system disables animations, navigation MUST finish without the slide or blur.
Source: pulls.review DESIGN rules 78 and 105, `PagedSheetPanel` and `BlurSwitch`,
at ee5cf358333cb1170f1923c7118e12af3f265b74; see `docs/pully-ui-reference.md`.

@cc [owner:OctavianTocan,label:design] card-sheet-header-stays-clear
A card sheet MUST have one header above its scrolling content. The leading close
or Back control MUST remain separate from the title and have a 44dp target. Content
scrolling under the header MUST fade through the sheet's paper, leaving the title
and controls sharp and unobstructed.
Source: pulls.review `kit-sheet-header-is-fixed`, DESIGN rules 70, 74 and 77,
at ee5cf358333cb1170f1923c7118e12af3f265b74; see `docs/pully-ui-reference.md`.

@cc [owner:OctavianTocan,label:product;motion] first-space-creation-is-a-child-page
From a card's empty space selector, Create Your First Space MUST open a creation
page inside the same card sheet and retain its selected card, accent hint, panel and
drag state. Header Back and Android Back MUST return to the space selector, then
to card actions, then dismiss. A failed creation MUST preserve the form for retry;
success MUST return to the space selector without automatically adding the card.
Source: Tavi's same-sheet child navigation requirement, 22 October 2026; applies
card-sheet-pages-stay-in-the-sheet to the first-space creation path.

@cc [owner:OctavianTocan,label:design] card-sheet-actions-have-hierarchy
The root action sheet MUST combine quick-action tiles with separate, titled raised
cards for organizing, discovering and managing a card, omitting empty sections.
Section headings MUST be small, muted and non-folding, without a count, divider or
chevron. The destructive action MUST sit in its own group. Cards and tiles use
16dp corners and Pully's 2dp-down, 12dp-blur, 10% ink canvas shadow with its tight
edge; header controls use the 10dp/8% variant. The title MUST remain centered in
its own fixed area even while its animated content changes. The grabber has a
14dp gap to the header; the first content respects Pully's 20dp top gap.
Source: pulls.review DESIGN rules 45, 70, 74 and 141; SheetHeading, SheetCard,
QuickAction and SheetHeader at f651a784cfca9b3730c60116832b89bbe236c9c3;
Tavi's 22 October 2026 request to port the composition as well as sheet motion.

@cc [owner:OctavianTocan,label:design] card-sheet-accent-is-only-a-top-hint
A card sheet MUST keep neutral Pully paper, raised groups, controls and primary
actions. The selected card's accent MUST be limited to a faint wash fading out
within the top 64dp and the grabber. Child pages MUST retain that hint without
tinting the body or their fields. Semantic colors such as Delete and space
selection colors remain independent of the card-type accent.
Source: Tavi's explicit correction, 22 October 2026: "Don't paint the entire
bottom sheets in the color of the card type, just a little hint at the top of it".

@cc [owner:OctavianTocan,label:product] card-share-sheet-offers-what-the-card-has
The reader's Share button MUST open a Share sheet in the card's sheet, titled Share,
offering only what the card has: The link for a card with a web link, The words for
a note or a post (a post's words carry its link), and Copy link. Each choice closes
the sheet before it hands off to the system's share sheet or the clipboard.
Source: Tavi's pick of F08 in the reader prototype, 28 October 2026.
